Hi, I think the problem occurs because GMRF(Q) evaluates the log-determinant of the singular matrix Q. However,
there is no need to evaluate the determinant. Try if

nll -= Type(0.5)*m*log_lam - 0.5*exp(log_lam)*GMRF(S).Quadform(x);

does the job. Here, "m" is the dimension of "x".

Hans

