Archived-At: <https://groups.google.com/g/tmb-users/c/bapEetDG2yI/m/uokFC1cACAAJ>
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset="utf-8"
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Ben,

If I remember correctly, I was able to recover the thetas from the
correlation matrix with this code:

    cc <- chol(cr)
    cc <- cc %*% diag(1 / diag(cc))
    cc[upper.tri(cc)]

Best,

Balint

